PSIPRED

--- A,M,K,G,L ( Protein Sequence ) ------->(folds)----> it can be Alpha-helices(spirals), Beta-sheets(arrows),coils(loops)

Now the question, How can you predict the shpe of protein?

* It predicts the secondary structure of proteins (helices, sheets,oils)
* It uses powerful algorthims + position - specific scoring (PSI_BLAST)
* It gives an easy-to-read visualization of the predicted structure.

Helps in understanding protein function.

----> A great first step in structural biology , drug design, & molecular research.

